## Radio Verdane

::sfx{sound="radio-static"}
::music{action="change" mood="tense" volume="normal"}
@announcer{code="0010"}: Good morning, Verdane! It's {{clock.weekdayLabel}}, and the weather along the coast is...
::sfx{sound="radio-squeal"}
@vex{code="0010" vo}: Citizens of Verdane. Forgive the interruption. I am Director Vex, of Team Eclipse.
@vex{code="0020" vo}: There are monsters in this region older than your towns. In the rock under your feet. In your towers. In the sky.
@vex{code="0030" vo}: You leave them to sleep. We will put them to work. Team Eclipse thanks you in advance for staying out of our way.
::sfx{sound="radio-static"}
@announcer{code="0020"}: ...we appear to have lost the signal. Please stay tuned.
@narrator{code="0010"}: Every radio in the region said the same thing, word for word, at the same moment.
::accept{quest="eclipseArc"}
